    },
    {
      "displayText": "Encore merci pour la dernière fois ! Tout le monde\nn’a d’yeux que pour mes lentilles de couleur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai récemment entendu dire que le Pokémon\nCharmina maîtrisait naturellement le yoga.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCela paraît incroyable, n’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du coup, si un Charmina méga-évolue...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044007500200063006F00750070002C00200073006900200075006E00200043006800610072006D0069006E00610020006D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C00750065002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce qu’il devient un... « Yoga-Charmina » ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C002000640065007600690065006E007400200075006E002E002E002E002000AB00200059006F00670061002D0043006800610072006D0069006E0061002000BB0020003F00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Blague à part, je sens que ce Méga-Charmina\nvaut vraiment le coup d’œil. Je veux en voir un !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est la dernière fois que je t’importune. Bats-toi\ncontre moi en faisant appel à un Méga-Charmina !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois qu’ils vendent la Méga-Gemme\nde Charmina au Joyau de Kalos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F0069007300200071007520190069006C0073002000760065006E00640065006E00740020006C00610020004D00E900670061002D00470065006D006D0065000A0064006500200043006800610072006D0069006E00610020006100750020004A006F0079006100750020006400650020004B0061006C006F0073002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bats-toi contre moi en faisant appel\nà un Méga-Charmina !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPour cela, il te faudra un Charmina dans\nton équipe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bats-toi contre moi en faisant appel\nà un Méga-Charmina !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPour cela, ton Charmina doit tenir la bonne\nMéga-Gemme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bats-toi contre moi en faisant appel\nà un Méga-Charmina !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740073002D0074006F006900200063006F006E0074007200650020006D006F006900200065006E002000660061006900730061006E007400200061007000700065006C000A00E000200075006E0020004D00E900670061002D0043006800610072006D0069006E00610020002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça marche ! Vive le yoga !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006D0061007200630068006500200021002000560069007600650020006C006500200079006F00670061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu ne comprends pas... Le Tout-Illumis a besoin\nde ces nouvelles lentilles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En méditant avec ton Méga-Charmina, je pourrai\ncréer des lentilles qui transcendent la spiritualité !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’inspiration ne me viendra pas si le combat\nse termine sans que je voie un Méga-Charmina !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAllez, encore une fois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Charmina était tellement merveilleux que\nmon inspiration semble désormais sans limites !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les idées fusent dans ma tête...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007300200069006400E90065007300200066007500730065006E0074002000640061006E00730020006D00610020007400EA00740065002E002E002E00100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qui dit « Pokémon » dit « Poké Ball » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500690020006400690074002000AB00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000BB0020006400690074002000AB00200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C002000BB0020002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et les Poké Balls m’évoquent la technologie\net son progrès inarrêtable... Des thèmes<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nqui à leur tour m’évoquent... les cyborgs !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fans de lentilles de couleur d’Illumis, chantez\nmes louanges ! Voici mes nouvelles créations !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les lentilles de couleur « Poké Ball »\net « Cyborg » sont désormais disponibles !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour tout !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÀ partir de maintenant, j’essaierai de faire\nméga-évoluer les Pokémon moi-même.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Essaie mes lentilles ! Et si tu en trouves\nqui te plaisent, prends un selfie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
